  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"> </p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/87nk2p2/One-Block.png\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gSdwYqP/double.png\" width=\"507\" height=\"122\"></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">这就像来自 <em>IJAMinecraft</em> 的 <strong>OneBlock</strong> 地图一样，是一张冒险地图。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">在这张地图上，你将出现在虚空中悬浮的一个方块上。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">你将永远打破 <strong>两个</strong> <strong>幸运方块</strong>！祝你好运！<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"> </p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/p6qDXGT/2024-01-30-15-48-31.png\" width=\"615\" height=\"346\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"> </p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://ibb.co/5WyT6XT\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://ibb.co/5WyT6XT\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">欢迎来到 <em><strong>Lucky OneBlock Double（双倍幸运一砖）！</strong></em></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">这张 Minecraft 地图将带你踏上一段激动人心的</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">以 <em><strong>单个</strong></em> <em><strong>幸运方块</strong></em> 为中心的冒险和挑战之旅。<br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">准备好体验充满 <strong>惊喜</strong>、<strong>危险</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">和 <strong>机遇</strong> 的独特有限世界吧。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ws9nr27/2024-01-30-15-35-28.png\" width=\"620\" height=\"344\"><br></span></p><hr><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4YQSMmq/This-map-requiere-mod.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">